(This project leverages a Transformer model which is built from scratch to translate text from English to) Tj
T* (Telugu. It uses a large parallel corpus of English-Telugu sentences to train the model, ensuring) Tj
T* (coverage of diverse linguistic nuances. The attention mechanism in Transformers aids in capturing) Tj
T* (context and handling long-range dependencies, which is crucial for translating complex sentence) Tj
T* (structures. Additional tokenization and transliteration layers help correctly map Telugu script) Tj
T* (characters and preserve meaning across language boundaries. Ultimately, the goal is to provide fast,) Tj
T* (accurate translations that enhance digital communication and knowledge sharing for Telugu speakers) Tj
