(This project leverages a Vision Transformer \(ViT\) to automate damage identification and prioritization) Tj
T* (from uploaded images. First, the ViT classifies the type of damage \(e.g., cracks, dents, corrosion\) and) Tj
T* (assesses its severity, drawing on learned features that capture subtle visual details. Next, the system) Tj
T* (generates a concise text summary that documents the specific damage type, severity level, and) Tj
T* (recommended repair priority. This integrated approach streamlines inspection workflows, cuts down) Tj
T* (manual evaluation, and delivers consistent, data-driven insightsparticularly useful for industries like) Tj
T* (insurance, automotive, construction, or manufacturing. By combining powerful vision models with) Tj
T* (intelligent text generation, the project ensures both accurate visual analysis and clear, actionable) Tj
T* (reporting for damage assessment.) Tj
